## 1. DEVICE IDENTIFICATION:
id: siemens-s7-1200-cpu-1214c
name: "Siemens SIMATIC S7-1200 CPU 1214C — Compact PLC, 100KB work memory, 14 DI 24VDC, 10 DO, 2 AI 0-10V, 6xHSC 100kHz, 4xPTO, PROFINET, Modbus TCP, OPC UA, 3 CM + 8 SM + 1 SB expansion"
