## 3. ELECTRICAL PROFILE (POWER PINS):
# Format: name | direction | voltage | type
# DC/DC/DC and DC/DC/RLY: 24VDC supply, range 20.4-28.8VDC, max 1.5A input
# AC/DC/RLY: 85-264VAC 47-63Hz, max 0.5A@120VAC or 0.25A@240VAC; inrush 20A peak
# L+ and M are CPU power; 24VDC encoder/sensor supply output (max 300mA) available on terminal
# PE: Protective Earth — mandatory for AC/DC/RLY variant; recommended for DC variants
