  L_PLUS|input|"24V"|null
  M_MINUS|null|null|ground
  L_AC|input|"230V"|null
  N_AC|null|null|ground
  PE|null|null|ground
  SENS_PWR|output|"24V"|null
  SENS_GND|null|null|ground

## 4. GPIO MAP:
# Format: pin | type | pwm | int | label | roles
# All DI: 24VDC sink/source; IEC Type 1; isolation 707VDC field-to-logic; 1 group
# HSC inputs Ia.0-Ia.5: up to 100kHz single-phase / 80kHz differential; cable max 50m shielded
# Standard DI Ia.6-Ib.5: up to 30kHz for HSC / 20kHz differential; filter 0.1-20ms configurable
# DO DC (MOSFET sourcing): 24VDC 0.5A; Qa.0-Qa.3=100kHz PTO; Qa.4-Qb.1=20kHz PTO; no overcurrent protection
# DO Relay: SPST-NO 2A 250VAC/30VDC; 2 isolation groups; 1500VAC group-to-group; 10ms; 10M mech
# AI: 0-10VDC only; 10-bit; 625µs/ch; no isolation from CPU logic; ≥100kΩ input resistance
